01:10:57,676 --> 01:11:01,376
So have the ability and wherewithal to know that the reversal has failed.

1172
01:11:01,676 --> 01:11:02,876
Don't fall on your sword.

1173
01:11:03,576 --> 01:11:06,076
I don't say, I got to take this reversal no matter what.

1174
01:11:06,476 --> 01:11:09,476
Recognize that when it's going to fail and just get out.

1175
01:11:10,376 --> 01:11:13,518
So while spotting reversals early can improve your trading immensely,

1176
01:11:13,518 --> 01:11:16,975
it's one of the more difficult skills to master in trading.

1177
01:11:17,376 --> 01:11:19,476
Practice and patience is key.

1178
01:11:21,676 --> 01:11:26,076
Now, Initiative volume is what you have to watch for in the move out of absorption.

1179
01:11:26,676 --> 01:11:30,376
And if you could see it in the move out of consolidation as well.

1180
01:11:30,976 --> 01:11:33,349
And basically what has happened is the

1181
01:11:33,349 --> 01:11:35,722
big traders have absorbed the aggressive trading

1182
01:11:35,722 --> 01:11:38,774
and is now aggressive trading in the opposite direction.

1183
01:11:39,676 --> 01:11:44,276
With consolidation, you don't have the big traders absorbing anything because there's lack of volume.

1184
01:11:44,576 --> 01:11:46,788
But when you're moving out of consolidation,

1185
01:11:46,788 --> 01:11:49,000
which is lack of volume, and you

1186
01:11:49,000 --> 01:11:52,476
see strong initiative selling or initiative buying go in that direction.

1187
01:11:53,676 --> 01:11:55,176
So this concludes Module 4.

1188
01:11:55,476 --> 01:11:57,176
I'll see you on the next module.

